<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CARL"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Cosmos openeing sequence</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> Cuisine</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Cuisine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A taste bud odyssey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> A Taste Bud Odyssey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>By me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> By Carl </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sagan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Carl </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sagan</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Finish sequence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sagan</Text>
      <Text> standing on the ship of the imagination.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>For the universe we started on a cliff face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>For cuisine we begin outside the kitchen, on our ship...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Of the culinary imagination.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Wine is plentiful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The bread. Always fresh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And there’s. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A tingling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In the tummy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 4/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CARL"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GUY"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. kitchen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl stands behind the counter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We are exploring the excessive caloric-content foods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Or as they are commonly called: Dessert.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Here on the ship of culinary imagination we can conjure up the perfect assistant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>One that knows a great deal about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The sweet stuff.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GUY FIERI steps in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GUy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Man, this is a weird ass Chili’s!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The temperature is optimal, Guy Fieri.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl looks off in a pensive stare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Carl </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sagan</Text>
      <Text>! Yeah man, it’s </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">smokin’</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No, it’s baking!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A cherry pie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now first, if you were to embark on the journey of creating a cherry pie from scratch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You would of course.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Need to create.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Luckily, we already have one prepared.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Outta</Text>
      <Text> sight!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In fact, it is all around you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Shoot in 50mm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to fieri)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It is you, my little star child.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>There’s a glow of light around Fieri.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Guy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey! Quit joking about my hair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Guy brushes it off and waddles in place.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Guy (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Alright.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So first we take the pie plate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl reveals he has a clear pie plate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A simple piece of glass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Made of melted silicon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Forged in the immense heat of a sun. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Billions and billions of years ago.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There’s no telling the distance these atoms have traveled to become the vessel of delicious pie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Outta</Text>
      <Text> bounds!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That is deep!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Deeper than the bounds of human imagination.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We don’t have time for this, man!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We gotta make a PIE!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Nonsense, we have all the time in the known universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No, it appears my floor producer is telling me we are- </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In fact out of time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Next time we will continue our culinary journey by harnessing the elemental structure of gnocchi with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Giada</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">DeLaurentis</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Music. Fake credits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Dang</Text>
      <Text>! So, no pie?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I don’t know what we’re going to do with this universe we already prepared!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

